      "content": "but grounding feels like a lie. pretending that my feet are on the floor doesn't change the fact that i'm not really \"here\" anymore. everything is just... static. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be to stop fighting the current and just let it take me under. it feels like the only way to actually find that peace i'm looking for.",
